64","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/898","id":741932364,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc0MTkzMjM2NA==","user":{"login":"lxea","id":7910815,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTA4MTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7910815?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea","html_url":"https://github.com/lxea","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-12-09T17:39:26Z","updated_at":"2020-12-09T18:36:49Z","body":"Having spent a bit of time debugging this, I changed some conditionals to make this use shaderc and it doesnt fail to compile the render crate now, it still segfaults though, however I think the issue is in the rodio alsa crate","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/741932364/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lxea","id":7910815,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTA4MTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7910815?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea","html_url":"https://github.com/lxea","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxea/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/769746271","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/898#issuecomment-769746271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/898","id":769746271,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc2OTc0NjI3MQ==","user":{"login":"inodentry","id":40234599,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMjM0NTk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40234599?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry","html_url":"https://github.com/inodentry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-01-29T11:21:33Z","updated_at":"2021-01-29T11:22:25Z","body":"Yes, FYI (to anyone attempting to compile Bevy apps for any target other than the most common explicitly supported ones (x86_64 windows/linux-gnu/macos, AArch64 ios/android/macos, wasm)):\r\n\r\nBevy uses a temporary ugly hack for shader compilation (`bevy-glsl-to-spirv`) that makes builds on the officially-supported platforms easier by using some precompiled C/C++ binaries (to avoid the need for extra build tools). However this means that on *unsupported* platforms, bevy will fail to compile.\r\n\r\nTo use bevy on other platforms, you need to switch out `bevy-glsl-to-spirv` for `shaderc`. This is currently done in the official bevy for iOS and Arm macOS. You can just simply patch your bevy to remove the conditional selection of `shaderc` for only those platforms, to use it unconditionally. This should unblock Bevy to compile for your target, at the cost of extra build-time dependencies (`ninja`, `cmake`, `python`).\r\n\r\nYou need to remove the conditional compilation checks in the `Cargo.toml` and in `crates/bevy_render/src/shader/shader.rs` (also remove the conflicting `bevy-glsl-to-spirv` code).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/769746271/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"inodentry","id":40234599,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMjM0NTk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40234599?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry","html_url":"https://github.com/inodentry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inodentry/repos","events_url":"htt